n":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"They say there's a knight on the road past Vesper Ford who stops everyone. Nobody gets by him.","zh":"听说过了晚祷渡的那条大路上，有个骑士把路拦住了，谁也过不去。"}}]}}},{"id":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"frostfang.thornridge-shrine.folk1"}}]}